# The only environment variable this app reads. Copy to `.env.local` (or
# `.env`) — never commit the copy; `.env*` is gitignored and only this
# `.example` is tracked.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is the origin of the Admin Worker — the BFF for this
# console. It is NOT the Identity Worker's origin. The Admin Worker reaches
# identity only through a private service binding and holds no `IDENTITY_DB`
# binding of its own, so a console pointed at the Identity Worker would be
# asserting a topology the deployment does not have.
#
# The value must be an absolute origin, not a relative path. The dev server and
# the deployed console are on different origins, and a relative URL would
# resolve against whichever one happened to load the bundle.
#
# For local `wrangler dev` against the Admin Worker, use the origin `wrangler
# dev` prints. Every administrative route on it answers 501 in the bootstrap
# phase, and this console renders that honestly rather than pretending otherwise.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8788
